# OpenRouter — Hybrid (recommended)
# Gemini 2.5 Flash for extraction (best strict-JSON / dollar), GLM-4.5-Air for summary
# (cheap and writes good prose), GPT-5-mini for coding (bounded reasoning, accurate
# ICD/SNOMED mapping). Default falls back to Gemini Flash for any future call type.
# Realized cost ~ $0.0095 / encounter — cheapest of the documented presets.
#
# Extract fit: gemini-2.5-flash handles the new prompt (severity, temporality,
# inter-fact relationships) reliably. If you need maximum graph richness,
# swap AI_MODEL_EXTRACT to openai/gpt-5-mini — reasoning-capable, ~2× cost.
# See docs/ai-providers.md -> "Model-fit guidance for the extraction step".

AI_PROVIDER=openai
AI_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
AI_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-CHANGE-ME

AI_MODEL=google/gemini-2.5-flash
AI_MODEL_EXTRACT=google/gemini-2.5-flash
AI_MODEL_SUMMARY=z-ai/glm-4.5-air
AI_MODEL_CODING=openai/gpt-5-mini

AI_EMBEDDING_MODEL=openai/text-embedding-3-small
